<title>UK: GWR pretax profits rise sharply in year.</title>
<headline>GWR pretax profits rise sharply in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.0		    vs 6.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.60		   vs 2.17</p>
<p> Pretax		     8.23		   vs 5.31</p>
<p> Turnover		   52.22		  vs 31.99</p>
<p> Operating profit	 7.64		   vs 5.32</p>
<p> Tax			  2.45		   vs 1.72</p>
<p> Retained profit	  2.51		   vs 2.19</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 12</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Expanding UK commercial radio operator GWR Group Plc said it was enjoying a strong period of revenue growth.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
